BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-chest@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 胸 55min
DESCRIPTION:悍马机卧推 热3+正4×8-10\n上斜悍马机卧推 4×8-10\n把手式蝴蝶机飞鸟 3×10-12\n站姿龙门架飞鸟(高位→下夹) 3×12-15\n练后：爬坡20min
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
DURATION:PT55M
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-back@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 背 55min
DESCRIPTION:轨道划船器划船 4×8-10\n反握器械高位下拉 4×8-10\n山羊挺身 3×10-12\n直臂下压 3×10-12\n练后：爬坡20min
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
DURATION:PT55M
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-shoulder@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 肩 55min
DESCRIPTION:哑铃侧平举(递减组) 4×12-15\n站姿杠铃实力推 4×6-8\n蝴蝶机反向飞鸟 4×10-12\n面拉 3×12-15\n绳索侧平举(单手) 3×12-15\n练后：爬坡20min
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TH
DURATION:PT55M
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-legs@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 腿 55min
DESCRIPTION:杠铃深蹲 热2+正4×6-8\n罗马尼亚硬拉 4×8-10\n腿屈伸 3×12-15\n坐姿腿弯举 3×10-12\n髋外展 3×12-15\n髋内收 3×12-15\n哈克机提踵 3×12-15
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=FR
DURATION:PT55M
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-arms@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 手臂 45min
DESCRIPTION:超级组① 绳索下压→哑铃弯举 3×10-12\n超级组② 颈后臂屈伸→器械弯举 3×10-12\n超级组③ 过头臂屈伸→锤式弯举 3×12-15\n腹肌 悬垂举腿/卷腹 3×15-20\n练后：爬坡20min
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SA
DURATION:PT45M
END:VEVENT

